    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And þæt is þonne ærest, þæt he his agenne wer gesille þam cyninge ⁊ Christe ⁊ mid þam hine silfne inlagige to bote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the first condition is, that he shall give his own wergeld to the king and to Christ, and by that means obtain the legal right to offer compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þæt is þonne ærest, þæt he his agenne wer Christe ⁊ þam cyninge gesylle ⁊ mid þam hine sylfne inlagie to bote.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
